```text
Shape: two caller-controlled string lengths; the current recursive branching state space is exponential and repeatedly slices inputs.
Worst case: mismatching strings can trigger exponential time (plus recursion/slicing overhead), exceeding the one-second case deadline; memory is recursion-depth and temporary-slice dependent.
Bound: one second per case, with a two-row/one-row dynamic program giving O(len(source)*len(target)) time and O(min lengths) space.
